spice
* SPICE Netlist

* Voltage Source
V1 7 0 DC Vin

* Current Source
IB 63 3 DC I_B

* Resistors
RD 5 2 RD_value
RB 3 4 RB_value
R1 7 1 R1_value
RS 2 0 RS_value

* Capacitor
Cin 1 2 Cin_value

* MOSFETs
M1 2 1 3 3 NMOS
MB 3 3 4 3 PMOS

* .MODEL statements for MOSFETs
.model NMOS NMOS
.model PMOS PMOS

* Analysis commands
.end